title: The 2027 election horizon

@election_year_opens_2027
# prose-audit: Grade A — The opening event frames the campaign through a clean choice between governing record, organisation and independence, and each branch shifts the coalition narrative without pretending the result is already fixed.
title: The election year opens
subtitle: Decide which part of eight years of political memory should define Lewica's last campaign.
