= Autumn 2027 — the counterfactual term continues

An earlier election reset the Sejm and Senate term. Another vote now would
ignore the constitutional calendar created by that break in the sequence, so
this horizon closes on the record left by the replacement parliament instead.

- @earlier_election_epilogue_2027

